<h2><strong><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #1a1d28;">Binance Historical VWAP Data</span></strong></h2>
<p><span style="color: #1a1d28;">For Binance, we provide VWAP data aggregated minutely, hourly, or daily, with historical data back to 2017-08-17.&nbsp; We calculate VWAP weighted by volume with a one minute frequency and a configurable lookback period. It is derived from the OHLCV data with the following calculation: (H+L+C) / 3.</span></p>
<p><span style="color: #1a1d28;">Our VWAP data is available via REST API for historical (time series) data as well as WebSockets for real-time data.</span></p>
<p><span style="color: #1a1d28;">Here is a </span><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1VuzUvJDHFSNPHu5I-fWunOxoKk6V24zWcUwLN628t7E/edit#gid=1818969799"><span>sample file</span></a><span style="color: #1155cc; text-decoration: underline;">.</span></p>
