<h2><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Binance Data Delivery &amp; Partnerships</span></strong></h2>
<p><span style="color: #000000;">Amberdata’s Binance datasets can be accessed via multiple delivery channels, such as REST APIs, Snowflake, Google Cloud’s Analytics Hub, and Databricks. These methods ensure smooth integration of Binance market data into users' trading strategies, analytics, and research processes. The available datasets include:&nbsp;</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="color: #000000;" aria-level="1"><span style="color: #000000;">Order Book Snapshots&nbsp;</span></li>
